================================================================================
Data
================================================================================

This dashboard analyses data published by the Office of the UN High
Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) at the Universal Human Rights Index
(https://uhri.ohchr.org/en). OHCHR's data terms apply to the underlying data;
they are not affected by the licence on this software.

